<item>
            <title>[PLM-1018] Enhancement to add Rejection Reason with details in Resubmission-RCM</title>
                <link>https://gooddoctortech.atlassian.net/browse/PLM-1018</link>
                <project id="10125" key="PLM">Platform</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Figma:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/design/IHYZXjNbDZBV1CRoTkpy2r/-PLTV--Rejection-Reason-in-RCM--GDMS-?node-id=1-70&quot; title=&quot;smart-link&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;https://www.figma.com/design/IHYZXjNbDZBV1CRoTkpy2r/-PLTV--Rejection-Reason-in-RCM--GDMS-?node-id=1-70&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Context:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://gooddoctor-talk.slack.com/archives/C05NL6VLC13/p1789176801259139&quot; title=&quot;smart-link&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noreferrer&quot;&gt;https://gooddoctor-talk.slack.com/archives/C05NL6VLC13/p1789176801259139&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Definition of Done:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Admin can see Rejection Reason from earlier Claim Request on Resubmission for Registration and Discharge
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If Rejection Reason from earlier Claim Registration Request, then System will show Reason only on Resubmission Registration Form&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;If Rejection Reason from earlier Claim Discharge Request, then System will show Reason on Resubmission Registration and Discharge Form&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;




&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;User Flow Journey:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;On RCM Menu, Admin can submit reject on Claim Request/Resubmission for registration and discharge&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;If Admin submit reject on Claim Request/Resubmission Registration on claim request ID: 1, then
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;on claim request ID: 2 as resubmission registration, Admin can see Rejection Reason with details on form&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://gooddoctortech.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/60557&quot; alt=&quot;image-20260925-034130.png&quot; width=&quot;696&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;on claim request ID: 3 as resubmission discharge, Admin do not see any Rejection Reason at all from claim request ID: 1&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://gooddoctortech.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/60555&quot; alt=&quot;image-20260925-034239.png&quot; width=&quot;696&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;If Admin submit reject on Claim Request/Resubmission Discharge on claim request ID: 2, then
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;on claim request ID: 3 as resubmission registration, Admin can see Rejection Reason with details on form from claim request ID: 2&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://gooddoctortech.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/60557&quot; alt=&quot;image-20260925-034130.png&quot; width=&quot;696&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;on claim request ID: 4 as resubmission discharge, Admin can see Rejection Reason with details on form from claim request ID: 2&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://gooddoctortech.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/60556&quot; alt=&quot;image-20260925-034222.png&quot; width=&quot;696&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
